{"title":"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Official_MAA)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Official MAA)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Purple_Comet_Math_Meet_April_2020\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Purple Comet Math Meet April 2020</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the number of ordered pairs of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/a/7ca10ffe3531cf1faf6222be7eac407c47bef878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m,n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/8/f58eeda3bdcd886fcb69ec23d795693ab4b3a9a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${m^2n = 20 ^{20}}$\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In this problem, we want to find the number of ordered pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b7e4c455672c30d743cce7506408a40cb68129.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m, n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff20dc016a0eff9d65e268530abfe14e6b0f4c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2n = 20^{20}$\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/5/f157049ea72b7239fafc02b0d0816d5107e97f9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = m^2$\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore, we want two numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, such that their product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/b/38b10853d4ecaf618fdfcd13f4c73fe4d206ff59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20^{20}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a perfect square. Note that there is exactly one valid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for a unique <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/51783f7ba8d00ef6c228ec237705befcace9214b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{20^{20}}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" />. This reduces the problem to finding the number of unique perfect square factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/b/38b10853d4ecaf618fdfcd13f4c73fe4d206ff59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20^{20}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2c5933b40981c158033bd6a799b14f5c0aedd48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20^{20} = 2^{40} \\cdot 5^{20} = \\left(2^2\\right)^{20}\\cdot\\left(5^2\\right)^{10}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"253\" height=\"25\" /> Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/e/3eef9217d5eb0583dd7c5e95835e1e031ab6346c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21 \\cdot 11 = \\boxed{231}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"116\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><br />\n~superagh\n</p><p>~TheBeast5520\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Official_MAA.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Official_MAA)\">Solution 2 (Official MAA)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Official MAA)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad172b39bbe6c5bdff12e919e57d453334c76d5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20^{20}=2^{40}5^{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" />, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff20dc016a0eff9d65e268530abfe14e6b0f4c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2n = 20^{20}$\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />, there must be nonnegative integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> such that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19bf2d4e771d44f4862520be6609f2e75cac61d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2^a5^b$\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/9/46916fa47fe59cf9d665e7db9e4285df571f252a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2^c5^d$\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />. Then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/7/8875ebab11f83ecf97299dca25bfc3a3de6be3c3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a + c = 40\\]\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/6399054c63db743cf09b425bd411697b202e9d7a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2b+d = 20\\]\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" />\nThe first equation has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> solutions corresponding to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/3/783e3fd27c97b5f827eb2774a23425f7b1850992.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 0,1,2,\\dots,20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />, and the second equation has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> solutions corresponding to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/a/dfaf1e051fe6fc305e6474147fb95098984c6d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 0,1,2,\\dots,10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"133\" height=\"16\" />. Therefore there are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d16e878733860437710cd5d4cd037d25582261fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21\\cdot11 = \\boxed{231}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"114\" height=\"25\" /> ordered pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/a/7ca10ffe3531cf1faf6222be7eac407c47bef878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m,n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff20dc016a0eff9d65e268530abfe14e6b0f4c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2n = 20^{20}$\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zfChnbMGLVQ?t=4612\">https://youtu.be/zfChnbMGLVQ?t=4612</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VA1lReSkGXU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VA1lReSkGXU</a>\n</p><p>~ North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x0QznvXcwHY\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x0QznvXcwHY</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Va3MPyAULdU\">https://youtu.be/Va3MPyAULdU</a> \n</p><p>~avn\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Purple_Comet_Math_Meet_April_2020\">Purple Comet Math Meet April 2020</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Purple Comet Math Meet April 2020\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice, that this was the exact same problem (with different wording of course) as Purple Comet HS problem 3 and remembering the answer, put <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/8/088588d1a4e3d29296342af8ddcc200ced9723fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{231}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://purplecomet.org/views/data/2020HSSolutions.pdf\">https://purplecomet.org/views/data/2020HSSolutions.pdf</a>\n</p><p>~Lopkiloinm\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Gs27CPxRiTA\">https://youtu.be/Gs27CPxRiTA</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II\" title=\"2020 AIME II\">2020 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018011532\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 257/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1774/209